### ------------------------------------------------------------
### Manual API tests – open in VS Code with the "REST Client"
### extension and click "Send Request" above each block.
### ------------------------------------------------------------

@base = http://localhost:5000/api
# Paste the token from the login/register response here:
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Health check
GET {{base}}/health

### Register
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Devika",
  "email": "devika@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "devika@example.com",
  "password": "secret123"
}

### Current user
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a note
POST {{base}}/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "DBMS revision",
  "content": "Normal forms: 1NF, 2NF, 3NF, BCNF",
  "tags": ["study", "exam"],
  "pinned": true,
  "color": "yellow"
}

### List notes (search, tag, sort are optional)
GET {{base}}/notes?search=dbms&tag=study&sort=updated
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one note
GET {{base}}/notes/NOTE_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update a note
PUT {{base}}/notes/NOTE_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "DBMS revision – done",
  "pinned": false
}

### Toggle pin
PATCH {{base}}/notes/NOTE_ID/pin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Set (or change) the lock password
PUT {{base}}/auth/lock-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newPassword": "1234"
}

### Lock a note
PATCH {{base}}/notes/NOTE_ID/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Open a locked note (returns the hidden content)
POST {{base}}/notes/NOTE_ID/unlock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "1234"
}

### Edit a locked note
PUT {{base}}/notes/NOTE_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Lock-Password: 1234
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Updated secret"
}

### Remove the lock
PATCH {{base}}/notes/NOTE_ID/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "1234"
}

### Stats
GET {{base}}/notes/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete a note
DELETE {{base}}/notes/NOTE_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
